@startuml robustness-uc12
title 图 2-16 UC-12 驳回处方 · 鲁棒图

skinparam {
  DefaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
  DefaultFontSize 12
  shadowing false
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  BorderColor #94A3B8
}

object "药师\n（参与者）" as ACT <<actor>>
object "药师审方页\nPharmacistReviewPage" as B_REVIEW <<boundary>>
object "PrescriptionReviewAppService\n（审方应用服务）" as C_REVIEW <<control>>
object "PrescriptionStateMachine\n（处方状态机）" as C_SM <<control>>
object "Prescription\n（处方）" as E_PRE <<entity>>
object "ReviewRecord\n（审方记录）" as E_REC <<entity>>
object "AuditLog\n（审计日志）" as E_AUDIT <<entity>>

ACT --> B_REVIEW : 1. 填写驳回理由并点击「驳回」
B_REVIEW --> C_REVIEW : 2. reject(prescriptionId, reason, version)
C_REVIEW --> E_PRE : 3. 加载处方并确认状态为待审核
C_REVIEW --> C_SM : 4. assertCanReject(status, version)
C_REVIEW --> E_PRE : 5. 状态改为已驳回，记录驳回理由
C_REVIEW --> E_REC : 6. 写审方记录（REJECTED，理由）
C_REVIEW --> E_AUDIT : 7. 写审计日志
C_REVIEW --> B_REVIEW : 8. 返回结果并通知医生端

note right of C_REVIEW
  驳回理由 ≥10 字，校验不过返回 400；
  驳回是责任记录，必须能查到「哪一版被谁以什么理由驳回」，
  因此不退回草稿状态。
end note
@enduml
